{{inh+|de|gmh|gegen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|gagan}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*gagin}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*gagin}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|tegen}}, {{cog|en|against}}, {{cog|is|gegn}}.

